title: Fixed 3 framework validator bugs from dealoracle field report (v6.6.2)
summary: Three Paradigm MCP validator bugs reported from the dealoracle project were each confirmed against framework code with writer/reader file:line evidence, fixed, reviewed (261/261 tests pass), and released as v6.6.2. Two were "validators disagree with each other" bugs rooted in duplicated/diverged path logic; the third was a junk-key bug in flow normalization.
